  {
    "id": 1010001000910010,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はいっ！　最近、ツイスタの投稿に\r\nいろんな反応がもらえるようになったなぁと思って！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100091/1010001000910010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000910020,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "見てもらえてるんだって実感が湧くと、\r\n気合が入りますね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100091/1010001000910020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（やる気充分って感じだな）",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "その調子で頑張れよ",
    "nextLabel": "1010001000911"
  },
  {
    "select": "今日はどんな反応が\r\n来てるんだ？",
    "nextLabel": "1010001000912"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "俺も見てるぞ",
    "nextLabel": "1010001000913"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000910030,
    "label": "1010001000911",
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい！\r\nもっとたくさんの人に見てもらわなきゃですからっ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100091/1010001000910030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000910040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "まめな投稿、心がけます！　……あ。チョコアイドルの\r\nオフショットとか載せるのもアリですかね？！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100091/1010001000910040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000910050,
    "label": "1010001000912",
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "お菓子とか……チョコとか……\r\n美味しそうなご飯屋さん情報とか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100091/1010001000910050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000910060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "！　ち、違いますよ！？　私が食べ物の話ばっかりするから\r\nこうなってるわけじゃないですからね？！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100091/1010001000910060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000910070,
    "label": "1010001000913",
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そ、そうだったんですか？\r\n……そっか、そうですよね、プロデューサーさんですし……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100091/1010001000910070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000910080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あんまり気にしてなかったんですけど、\r\nこういうのって、なんだかちょっと恥ずかしいです……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100091/1010001000910080"
  },
  {
